WEBVTT

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:04.737
Take a small game studio. One creative brief. A whole
business to run.

00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:10.889
Bring your team into shared documents and conversations.
Keep decisions beside the work.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.469
Build the prototype. Define the audience. Prepare the first
playtests.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:23.208
Then review what matters: the output. Clear feedback becomes
a better next version.

00:00:24.617 --> 00:00:29.023
Open the company computer. Try the work yourself. Decide
what is ready.

00:00:31.117 --> 00:00:36.123
Agents work within clear boundaries. You keep the judgment,
and control what goes out.
